  "interpretation": [
    "This is postprocessing of saved fields, with no new propagation.",
    "Both independently profile-aligned and directly propagated-control-aligned perturbation responses are compared.",
    "Periodization folds the large-domain residual outside [-80,80) into that window. It is a diagnostic, not a corrected nonlinear solution or an error bound.",
    "Near equality of the exterior norm and common-window discrepancy, together with their onset and reduced discrepancy after folding, supports radiation wrapping as the dominant mechanism. It does not exclude periodic mean-flow or later interaction effects.",
